#: views/settings-page.php:205
msgid "The \"Used In\" and \"Unused\" columns scan the content of every post and page to find where each media item is actually used. On large sites, or on small/shared hosting, this can be slow and memory-heavy and may hit a timeout or memory limit."
msgstr "“使用于”和“未使用”列会扫描每一篇文章和页面的内容，以查找每个媒体项目的实际使用位置。在大型网站或小型/共享主机上，此操作可能较慢且占用大量内存，并可能导致超时或达到内存限制。"

#: views/settings-page.php:208
msgid "If the export fails or times out, use \"Show Advanced Options\" below to export a smaller item range at a time."
msgstr "如果导出失败或超时，请使用下方的“显示高级选项”，每次导出较小的项目范围。"

#: views/settings-page.php:211
msgid "References added by page builders, sliders, custom fields, widgets or theme options are not scanned, so please confirm before deleting anything."
msgstr "页面构建器、幻灯片、自定义字段、小工具或主题选项中添加的引用不会被扫描，因此删除任何内容前请先确认。"

#: views/settings-page.php:218
msgid "\"Used In\" Options:"
msgstr "“使用于”选项："

#: views/settings-page.php:222
msgid "One row per usage"
msgstr "每处使用单独一行"

#: views/settings-page.php:225
msgid "An item used in 3 posts exports as 3 rows instead of one. \"Used In (count)\" still shows the total on every row."
msgstr "在 3 篇文章中使用的项目将导出为 3 行而非 1 行。“使用于（数量）”仍在每一行显示总数。"

#: views/settings-page.php:230
msgid "Only include items that are used somewhere"
msgstr "仅包含在某处被使用的项目"

#: views/settings-page.php:233
msgid "Leaves out every item whose count is 0."
msgstr "排除数量为 0 的所有项目。"

#: views/settings-page.php:238
msgid "Also scan custom fields and page-builder data (slower)"
msgstr "同时扫描自定义字段和页面构建器数据（较慢）"

#: views/settings-page.php:241
msgid "Also finds references in WooCommerce galleries, ACF fields and page-builder layouts. Often the reason a visible image reports 0. Reads every custom field, so it is slower."
msgstr "还会查找 WooCommerce 相册、ACF 字段和页面构建器布局中的引用。这通常是网站上明明可见的图片却显示 0 的原因。会读取全部自定义字段，因此较慢。"

